

      Carrot Ginger Soup

      3 c   sliced carrots
      1/2 c orange juice
      1 T   gratedfresh ginger
      1/2   habenero pepper
      3 T   apricot preserves or 
            orange marmelade
      1 T   butter
      1/8 t salt

      put Carrots, OJ, ginger, pepper  in 1 qt
       saucepan, boil then simmer 30 minutes

      add rest of ingrediments and puree 
      everything.